# Step-function ΔW/W, ΔD/D fixture for rosenthal_fluctuations.
# Columns: s[m]   dW_over_W   dD_over_D
#
# Along a 1-mm scan path: ΔW jumps from 0 to +0.20 at the midpoint
# (s = 0.5 mm). With dW>0 the source narrows eta_y -> the pool widens
# transversely. ΔD is held at 0 throughout.
0.0000e-3   0.00   0.00
0.4999e-3   0.00   0.00
0.5000e-3   0.20   0.00
2.0000e-3   0.20   0.00
